App Landing Page & App Store Screenshot Example
-----------------------------------------------

To create app landing page we can use github pages, to use github pages we can just fork this repo
https://emilbaehr.github.io/automatic-app-landing-page/

Can use this screenshot example https://apps.apple.com/app/githawk-for-github/id1252320249

Use this link to generate app store screenshot
    1) https://shotbot.io
    2) https://www.appstorescreenshot.com
    3) https://theapplaunchpad.com
    4) https://medium.com/appmanager/best-12-tools-to-create-amazing-screenshots-for-your-mobile-apps-2018-1cbf6f8660ba

